  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business case assessment and capacity building for stevia production, Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following a pre-feasibility study in 2021, this project will provide the next step in exploring opportunities for professional stevia production in the Lusaka region in Zambia. The project foresees further development of the business case for stevia production in the Magoye River region, providing an overview of investments and profits. Also, the project will initiate and support the required cooperation between the local small- and medium-scale farmers. These results will create a basis to set up stevia production, resulting in agricultural diversification, economic opportunities and a strengthened farmers community in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
